{"sections":[{"slug":"几何实现","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"几何实现"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">几何实现</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">作为米田扩张</span>)"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"几何实现 (作为米田扩张)"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">几何实现有两种不同的含义</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">本页面介绍的是其作为沿</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/米田嵌入","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">米田嵌入</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Kan扩张","text":"Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的含义</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">另见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/几何实现(单纯图表的余极限)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">几何实现</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">作为单纯图表的余极限</span>)"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">单纯集</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">可写成其单纯形的余极限</span>:\n$$\r\nX \\simeq \\lim_{\\longrightarrow \\atop \\Delta^n\\to X} \\Delta^n\r\n$$\n(<span lang=\"zh\">一般地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">预层总是可以写成</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可表函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可表函子</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的余极限</span>.) <span lang=\"zh\">此时</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">几何实现</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义为</span> $\\mathsf {Top}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的余极限</span>\n$$\r\n|X| := \\lim_{\\longrightarrow \\atop \\Delta^n\\to X} |\\Delta^n|.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">这个过程可表述为</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">几何单纯形</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">函子</span> $\\Delta \\to \\mathsf{Top}$ <span lang=\"zh\">沿</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/米田嵌入","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">米田嵌入</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\Delta\\to\\mathsf{sSet}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的左</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Kan扩张","text":"Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张</span>"}},{"Plain":".\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\Delta$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯形范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯形范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", $\\mathsf{sSet}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\Delta$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/预层意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">预层范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">当然</span> $\\Delta$ <span lang=\"zh\">可以替换为任何范畴</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">给定余完备范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">与函子</span> $F\\colon \\Delta \\to \\mathcal C$, <strong><span lang=\"zh\">几何实现</span></strong>\n$$\r\n|{-}|\\colon \\widehat {\\Delta} \\to \\mathcal C\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">就是其沿</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/米田嵌入","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">米田嵌入</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbf{y}\\colon \\Delta\\to\\widehat {\\Delta}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Kan扩张","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">左</span> Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张</span>"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\n|X| := \\operatorname{colim}_{\\mathbf{y}(d)\\to X}F(d).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">单纯集</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的几何实现</span> $|X|$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> CW <span lang=\"zh\">复形</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">几何实现保持纤维化</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong>. "},{"Local":{"url":"/Kan纤维化","text":"Kan <span lang=\"zh\">纤维化</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的几何实现是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Serre纤维化","text":"Serre <span lang=\"zh\">纤维化</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯对象</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/脉","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">脉</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}